              <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                <li><strong>Ben Dinh</strong> operates on a continuous conveyor belt of international packaged coach tours.</li>
                <li><strong>Ben Duoc</strong> operates at a peaceful, spacious pace oriented toward independent travelers, private tours, and commemorative groups.</li>
