                <li><strong>Public City Bus:</strong> Budget travelers can take Bus #13 from 23/9 Park to Cu Chi Bus Station, then transfer to Bus #79 directly to Ben Duoc gate. The trip takes 2.5 to 3 hours each way and costs under 30,000 VND.</li>
